cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SPECS Optical Compensation Layer"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-27"
authors:
  - family-names: "Feeney"
    given-names: "Don Michael"
    affiliation: "Bright Acts: People's Coin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-1350-4160"

abstract: >
  A minimal, cross-language optical compensation pipeline providing Python
  calibration, GLSL distortion-correction shaders, and a C++ runtime bridge.
  Converts device/user calibration into projection matrices and shader
  parameters, supports sensor-driven updates, and includes full tests and
  canonical PAPER.md synchronization.

keywords:
  - optical compensation
  - calibration engine
  - GLSL shaders
  - C++ runtime bridge
  - distortion correction
  - SPECS pipeline

repository-code: "https://github.com/dfeen87/SPECS-Optical-Compensation-Layer"
license: "MIT"
